        "created_at": "2013-03-31T07:14:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Infernal Relics has my favorite heroes, and environment (Realm of Discord), but Shattered Timelines has my favorite villains. Plus, Chrono is in my top 5 heroes, and the Time Cataclysm is a fun environment too.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Really, it depends on what you're looking for. There are already some good damage dealers (Expat, Ra, etc.) so IR would be good for the support heroes, but both expansions are worth getting.</p>",
