        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/y/779978/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-31T12:41:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think Shattered Timelines is the best expansion to date. You have two interesting heroes, villains with a variety of difficulties, and some good environments.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Infernal relics is more of a mixed bag. The heroes are excellent, but I find the Villains to be very weak (as in easy), and the environments are ok.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If I were to give grades, ST gets an A, and IR gets a B.</p>",
